# Optional shared default for every browser served by this dashboard.
# Copy to .env.local, set the same backend used by the phone, and restart Vite.
# VITE_LIVE_URL=ws://10.0.0.44:8765/live

# Recommended for multiple viewers: relay through the dashboard server so each
# browser only needs to reach the dashboard laptop. The phone keeps its /phone URL.
# VITE_LIVE_URL=/live
# GODSEYE_BACKEND_URL=http://10.0.0.44:8765

# Optional HTTPS for development and preview. Configure BOTH paths or neither.
# Use a certificate trusted by the viewing browser with the dashboard address
# in its subject alternative names. Keep certificate/key files outside this repo
# and outside Vite's served directories. See VR.md for Quest trust and USB setup.
# These GODSEYE_ values stay on the server; never use VITE_ for private keys.
# GODSEYE_TLS_CERT_FILE=/absolute/private/certs/dashboard.pem
# GODSEYE_TLS_KEY_FILE=/absolute/private/certs/dashboard-key.pem
